WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.010
Episode 45

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.010
Sonic Battle - Face Off!!

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:37.280
Have some flowers.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:38.910
Thank you.

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:42.740
Emerl!

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.040
So many flowers!

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.380
Thank you, Emerl!

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.050
I'm so happy!

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:59.300
I wish...

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:08.600
You're so noisy!

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:11.310
Emerl, this is for you.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.280
Here you go.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.280
Emerl seems happy too.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:22.410
See? He's happy.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:28.040
I'm glad that you're happy, Emerl.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.040
Let's make more together.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.590
Amy!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.970
Please stop.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.470
It got away!

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:47.310
Why did you stop me, Tanaka?

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:52.360
Amy, your hammer will shatter the window into pieces.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:57.150
Even the mosquito got away from me.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.530
My life is full of people getting away from me.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.740
Sonic always stands me up on dates.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:11.330
There there.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:15.040
Eat something sweet and cheer up, Amy.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:21.430
Amy, feeling both happy and sad is a fact of life.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:27.350
Sometimes you win, sometimes you lose. That's the same for everyone.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.690
Sonic always leaving things up to the wind.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.190
My love is like trying to grab a cloud.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:36.270
Actually, it's like trying to grab the wind.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:40.860
When will I ever be able to catch him?

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:53.250
You guys, go into town to do some shopping.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:53.750
Go...

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.330
...shopping?

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:59.000
Six tons of spikes and five thousand cans of varnish?

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.510
Wow! That's a lot, Dr. Eggman!

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:05.090
Why don't you ask for delivery?

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:07.970
You idiot! I would if I could!

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:10.310
Just hurry up and go!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.230
Yes, sir!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.600
Yes, sir!

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:21.110
Dr. Eggman has committed numerous evil acts, and he has recently escaped from prison.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:26.950
According to government authorities, he's now working on his most evil project ever.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:30.490
Therefore, the President has an anti-Eggman project.

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:33.500
He's requesting the help of Sonic, Knuckles and Rouge.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:37.960
He announced that he's developing a large scale strategy that centers around the three.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:44.550
The President is here to inspect the practice drills, so we were planning to ask him about his plans. However...

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:53.560
The President has asked for their help to stop Eggman.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:56.980
However, the three of them don't seem interested.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.650
Stop filming!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.780
What's going on?

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.150
Well...

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.910
I can't do it.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.530
I can't get excited if it's not an actual fight.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:09.740
An actual fight?

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:14.710
I can't get excited unless I receive extravagant gifts.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.250
Extravagant gifts?

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.460
For example, jewelry.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.210
I see. Then how about this.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.220
What if we have matches tournament-style?

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:30.050
The prize for the winner will be a Chaos Emerald!

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.430
What?

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:36.060
You're going to use a Chaos Emerald again to hook us?

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.020
Count me out.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:44.440
That's what you say, but in actuality, you don't think you can win.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:47.070
What? Don't touch me!

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:48.240
Stop poking me!

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:49.530
How disappointing.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.740
You're not entering the tournament.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:56.660
Totally. I'm disappointed in you, Knuckles.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.790
You're not manly.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:01.840
I misjudged you.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:05.170
I thought you were a warrior with courage and strength.

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:07.930
I didn't realize you were such a coward.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:13.140
Just be honest and tell them that you have no confidence in winning.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:17.730
Why don't you fight like a man, Knuckles?

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.810
Unless you really don't have the confidence.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:26.820
Fine! If you're going to go that far, I'll do it!

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:30.700
I'll win by a large margin! I won't lose!

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.780
That's the spirit.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:37.160
Knuckles, you're so easily provoked.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.960
He always falls for this.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.670
Because he's an idiot.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.500
Do your best.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.050
Do we actually have any Chaos Emeralds left?

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.050
Breaking news!

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:56.140
The President has just announced a martial arts tournament for a Chaos Emerald.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:07:00.640
Mr. President, please announce the date and location.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:07.030
In three days, the Chaos Emerald contest will take place at a specially-built stadium.

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:09.490
We're accepting contestants!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:15.780
Those watching on TV! Those who are at work!

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:19.330
Everyone, enter the Chaos Emerald martial arts tournament!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:24.880
The winner of the Chaos Emerald could be you!

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.460
We're accepting contestants.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:29.760
Call this phone number immediately!

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:33.090
Time for commercials!

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:47.320
I'll be the winner!

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:52.450
No one wants to die.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:56.280
No one will enter after seeing that commercial.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.870
Let's all enter the tournament.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:05.790
Didn't you just see Knuckles's commercial?

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:09.000
Now no one else will enter.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:14.300
Hello?

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:16.720
One moment please.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.060
Chris.

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:20.600
It's Mr. Thorndyke.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:21.930
Dad?

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.020
Hello?

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:28.320
What? Dad, you're entering the tournament?

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.070
What? Grandpa and me also?

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:36.870
You also entered Ella, Tanaka, Amy and Tails?

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:39.410
Me too?

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.910
Dad! Wait!

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.210
He hung up.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.920
He says he'll meets us at the stadium.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:51.630
The tournament brackets have been announced.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:57.640
Tickets are selling fast, but there are still some left.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.180
Call as fast as you can.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:00.930
Time for commercials.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:05.600
Will it be okay that there are more than 20,000 spectators?

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.860
Five tickets?

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:10.110
There are no more group tickets on the second floor.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.520
Two A seats.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.690
Ouch!

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:16.240
My delicate finger!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:21.990
This happened because Decoe and Bocoe haven't returned yet!

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:24.410
I'm really mad!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.460
Hey, Messenger Robo!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.040
Yes?

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:27.420
Oh, you're over there.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.130
What is it, Dr. Eggman?

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.880
Go find them right this minute!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.420
Aye aye, sir!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.670
Decoe? Bocoe?

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:45.980
We will now begin the Chaos Emerald martial arts tournament.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:53.730
The prize for the winner is a Chaos Emerald!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.570
These are the match-ups.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.700
It's hard to tell who's going to win.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.010
I'm so excited!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.800
The arena is full of excitement.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.840
There are no time limits in this tournament.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:24.220
Victory is determined by pins, surrendering or leaving the ring.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.310
Are you serious?

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:31.190
This has been my dream since childhood.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:37.860
Serving as the ring announcer, the famous director Emer Johnson has entered the arena.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:41.990
The Chaos Emerald martial arts tournament will begin shortly.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:46.660
In the red corner is President Michael K!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:51.670
And in the blue corner!

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.420
Black Knight!

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:00.090
Mr. President, you should give up.

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:00.630
No.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.890
Now let the match begin!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.410
First Round

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.410
1st Match
 Black Knight VS The President

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:11.480
At the sound of the bell, the President charges towards Black Knight!

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:15.070
He is continuously punching Black Knight's body!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:20.610
However, his punches are no match against Black Knight's steel armor!

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:26.370
Is Black Knight going to counterattack?

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:27.910
Mr. President!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.830
Black Knight advances to the second round!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.040
The President gave up.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:39.420
Why?

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:42.090
We can't afford something happening to you.

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:46.430
But I wanted to fight!

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:49.810
Let's begin the second match in the first round!

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.750
2nd Match
 Chris VS Danny

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:54.020
Here I go!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:56.520
Both contestants will simultaneously attack each other!

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.110
No, they won't!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.990
What's the matter, Chris?

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.490
I don't want to fight you.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:07.990
What are you talking about? There's no match if you don't fight.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.620
But we're friends!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:17.670
Sheesh! Francis and Helen, can you explain this to Chris?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:18.840
Now's my chance.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:20.880
You left yourself open!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:26.300
Chris made Danny lower his guard and tackled him!

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.430
Chris pins Danny!

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.680
That's cheating, Chris!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.600
You're such a softy, Danny!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:38.150
Christopher Thorndyke makes it to the second round by outsmarting him!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.030
I can't believe it!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.360
You did it, Chris.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:44.610
Yeah.

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:45.700
Huh?

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.120
Grandpa, what's with that outfit?

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:54.160
When I was young, I was known as the Red Rage!

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:57.830
Grandpa!

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:02.170
Grandpa, hang in there!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:10.600
Mr. Chuck Thorndyke unfortunately has to surrender due to a strained back.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:14.230
Therefore, his opponent wins by default.

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:17.920
3rd Match 
 E-77    wins by default

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:21.860
E-77 is lucky again.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:23.150
So true.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.200
Well, I'm fighting in the next match.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.240
Oh, me too.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:31.930
4th Match
 Bocoe VS Decoe

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.200
I won't show any mercy!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.960
I expect nothing less!

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.210
I'm gonna get you!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:48.220
Prison escapees, put your hands up!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:50.180
Oh no!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.140
Run for it!

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:52.600
After them!

00:13:56.440 --> 00:14:02.230
The next match is a super heavyweight fight. This will be worth watching!

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:04.420
5th Match
 Big VS Ella

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:07.860
Please stop!

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.490
Stop running and fight!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:13.160
Help me!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.410
Stop!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.790
No!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.500
Stop!

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:27.510
Whoa, Ella is down!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.970
This is a great chance for Big!

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.800
That was scary.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.970
Big is outside the ring, so he's disqualified!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.330
6th Match
 Tails VS Hawk

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:41.100
Okay, I'll give it my best shot!

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:50.280
Hawk from Oriental City is unleashing an all-out attack!

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:53.910
Tails, on the other hand, is focusing on defense!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:59.790
Hawk attacks Tails with a Heel Drop!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.340
Tails will try to stop it with his tail!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.050
You fell for it.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.130
I got you!

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.630
Oh no!

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.300
Just kidding!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:16.060
Tails with a brilliant come-from-behind victory!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.930
That's how you do it!

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:22.350
Tails!

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:25.360
Maybe I'm a bit stronger now.

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:27.090
7th Match
 Bokkun VS Amy

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:26.980
I'm Bokkun!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:30.320
Bokkun? You have a name?

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.490
I do...

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:36.580
That hurt!

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:43.670
Stop it. You're making me look like a bully.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.170
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:50.010
Amy Rose is a flowering maiden.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.470
Which part?

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.140
Did you say something?

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:58.010
No, I didn't...

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.480
You meanie!

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:06.190
Amy Rose wins by knockout!

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:09.990
Even a beautiful flower has its thorns.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:15.030
Please keep cheering for me!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:18.870
That's the end for the first round matches.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:21.540
There will now be an intermission.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.580
Here you go!

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:32.970
Where are Decoe, Bocoe and the Messenger Robo?

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.490
<i>Sign: Waiting Room</i>

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:39.680
I never thought you would use that strategy to win, Chris.

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:42.390
It's because everyone thinks I'm a good kid.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.190
I don't like that.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.100
Why?

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:49.190
Because I'm not a kid!

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:54.400
But if I'm a kid, I'll argue... and cheat.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.410
Am I wrong?

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.370
I'm okay with it.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:06.460
It's now time for the second round.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:12.550
The first match is Black Knight versus the tournament favorite Knuckles!

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:13.400
Second Round

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:13.400
1st Match
 Black Knight VS Knuckles

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.010
Attack me!

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.390
You think this is going to be easy?

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.680
Then I'll attack you!

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.020
Please!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.520
Please let me win!

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.900
Let you win?

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.610
Please!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.440
Jerome...

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:38.530
I can hardly make ends meet! Please show mercy!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:43.580
That doesn't mean I won't punish you!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:51.210
Black Knight leaves the ring, so Knuckles wins!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.460
Chris.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.510
Danny?

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:58.930
Give it your best shot, for my sake too!

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:00.720
Yeah.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:13.110
What a flashy entrance by the next competitor!

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:19.610
Dad?

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.850
2nd Match
Nelson VS Chris

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:26.750
Chris, if you want to make the quarterfinals, you'll have to beat me first!

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:34.000
It's like a lion throwing his cub into a bottomless ravine to make it stronger.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.340
I give up!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.090
The father was too weak.

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:42.280
3rd Match
 Sam Speed VS Mr. Stewart

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.260
Please take it easy on me.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.020
Here I come!

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.350
Wait!

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:49.640
Uncle, stop!

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:52.480
This is a man's fight, so stay out of it, Chris!

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:53.900
That's not it!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.570
They haven't rung the bell yet!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:01.530
I have quick hands, but I also leave quickly.

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:05.580
Mr. Stewart wins by disqualification.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:11.440
4th Match 
 E-77    wins by default

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:11.830
In the fourth match, since its opponent is on the lam, Lucky wins by default.

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:17.780
5th Match
 Topaz VS Tanaka

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:19.300
Come on!

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.810
Is this for me?

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:32.060
It looks very good on you.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.560
I'm so happy!

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:37.150
What's going on?

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:41.530
That's a total victory by Tanaka! He made her surrender!

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:42.910
Is this okay?

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.280
It's fine. You'll understand when you grow up.

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:47.580
Now it's my turn.

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:49.770
6th Match
 Emerl VS Ella

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.870
Emerl! Give it your best shot!

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:59.340
But don't hurt Ella!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.550
What's wrong?

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:09.520
He's confused by your orders, Cream.

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:11.770
Oh really?

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.980
Then what should I do?

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:18.610
All will be fine if I give up.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.030
Is that really okay?

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:24.740
It's fine. I have to make dinner anyway.

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:27.240
Thank you very much.

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:29.850
7th Match
 Rouge VS Tails

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.160
I can defeat you in seconds, Tails.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:34.170
Here I come!

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:38.750
There!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:42.840
They're both incredible! Their midair battle is an incredible sight!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.720
The little fox cub fights much better than I expected.

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:50.930
In that case...

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:56.650
Rouge wins easily using an adult attack.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:59.020
Tails was a child after all.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:01.900
This extravagant prize is meant for me.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:03.530
It's natural that I win.

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:07.160
There's only one match left in the second round.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:12.250
Both competitors are already in the ring and are waiting for the bell.

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.870
Fate is so cruel.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:19.920
Why do I have to fight against Sonic?

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:21.360
8th Match
 Amy VS Sonic

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.800
What's wrong?

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:27.260
We can't do this.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:30.680
Two people in love can't fight against each other.

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:33.560
We can't!

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:37.980
Chris, can you say something to provoke Amy?

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:40.020
What? Me?

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:43.190
I know Sonic feels the same way I do.

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:45.400
He's troubled!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:48.030
Please, Chris!

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:51.080
In her current state, nothing I say will affect her!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:57.000
Hey, that's Sonic!

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.960
Excellent timing.

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:02.460
Sonic, I...

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:04.920
There's a misunderstanding, Amy!

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:07.800
Push.

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:09.390
Amy!

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:10.970
Sonic!

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:16.140
Sonic, you finally understand how I feel!

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:17.190
Oops!

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:18.810
How dare you!

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:22.730
Sonic...

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:26.650
Sonic, you're so bashful.

00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:30.320
I'm going to stay out of this.

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:31.990
What a shocker!

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:36.790
Sonic, the contestant most likely to win the championship, loses by leaving the ring!

